# Population.Now does not require an API key.
#
# Country, region, and world lookups use:
# - the bundled United Nations World Population Prospects 2024 extract
# - the public World Bank API for indicator SP.POP.TOTL
#
# U.S. Census Bureau and Statistics Canada adapters are not enabled.
# Adding a key here will not turn on state, county, city, or province results.
